WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.500
Germany is a central European nation stretching from the Baltic Sea to the snow-capped Alps.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.000
The Zugspitze peak in the Bavarian Alps rises to 2,962 meters as Germany's highest elevation.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:17.000
In Berlin, the neoclassical Brandenburg Gate stands 26 meters tall as an emblem of unity.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:23.000
Alpine folk costume features leather Lederhosen breeches and Dirndl dresses tailored with linen.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:29.000
German music heritage was shaped by legendary classical composers like Bach, Beethoven, and Brahms.

